</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>With adoring heart, we render</l><l>Honor to Thy precious name,</l><l>Overflowing with Thy mercies,</l><l>Far and wide Thy worth proclaim.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Praise Him! praise Him! praise the Savior!</l><l>Saints, aloud your voices raise,</l><l>Praise Him! praise Him! till in glory</l><l>Perfected we’ll sing His praise.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
